body: "Overlap rechecked against main: pm-jira adfToPlainText flattens descriptions; existing export emits plain text as ADF; older attachment proposal is separate. pm-evidence owns generic citations, retention and freshness, not ADF structure. New scope: strict offline source snapshot plus explicit JSON-pointer selection; portable evidence packet with source revision and original coordinates, code/list/table boundaries, exclusion counts, approval bound to source digest, bounded agent output and typed refusals. No tracker mutations, journals, remote actions or attachment reads on this path; pm-evidence can cite the retained JSON output. Reuse the host command renderer, supported SDK loader, bounded file adapter and SDK testing harness. Existing native import/export/sync model regression will run in CI; new model checks capture against SDK-read native state without modifying it."
